5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The noise leaks through that thin wall. I need to know exactly what is being said in there.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am worried about the costs. We are already paying for this space, so I need to see the invoices.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who cleans up after everyone? I want to check the crumbs and the bins to see the mess.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,We are strangers despite working so close. I need to see where the awkward conversations happen.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know where the hours go. I will check the facilities callouts and the tally of use.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, money is important, but if the noise drives us mad, the cost is irrelevant.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree, but I cannot ignore the figures. I need to verify the outside hire costs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, that sounds serious! I hope we can fix it. I am still focused on the cleaning mess.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the mess is a symptom. The real issue is the lack of connection. I will look into the talk.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shion, noise is a burden on time. I need to see the callouts to understand the maintenance load.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the partition wall and the tally of use. I need to see who is causing the noise.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the invoices for outside hire and the quotes for the fit-outs. I need the numbers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the crumbs and bins and the final clear-out of the old fridge. I want to see the waste.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the unplanned talk and where the last awkward conversation happened. I need to understand the silence.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the facilities callouts and the fortnight's tally of use. I need to see the hidden hours.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
