63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option C is lonely. But Option A is messy and Option B is noisy. I vote C, reluctantly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C eliminates the callouts and the hoarding. It is the most efficient use of our time. I vote C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
